    "caption": "🔥 Dear startups, amazing opportunity for you!\n\n🪐 Silkroad Innovation Hub & Astana Hub are calling for applications for the Silkroad Startup Pavilion at TechCrunch on September 19-21.\n\nA limited number of startups will be selected and have a chance to present at the world's biggest startup event of the year — TechCrunch Disrupt 2023!\n\n🤩 Each selected startup will have a dedicated space at the exhibition and a chance to pitch to investors at TechCrunch 2023.\n\nStartups and ecosystem players from Central Eurasia (Kazakhstan, Uzbekistan, Kyrgyzstan, Tajikistan, Turkmenistan, Azerbaijan, Turkey & Mongolia) can apply for this event till August 18.\n\n📌 Event will be held at the Moscone Center, San Francisco, USA.\n\n❗️ Take the chance and apply for TechCrunch Disrupt by the link in profile description (taplink).",
